00:20:45.040 --> 00:20:53.520
And these come from AWS, the cider block size can&nbsp;
be between a slash 16 and slash 28 subnet mask,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:54.160 --> 00:21:00.480
it cannot overlap with any existing cider block&nbsp;
that's associated with the VPC. And you cannot&nbsp;&nbsp;

