might need an outbound rule for traffic going out&nbsp;
from our instances. So when our instances that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:00.160 --> 00:52:06.480
are attached to the security group are initiating&nbsp;
connections outbound. so here we can see we have&nbsp;&nbsp;

