00:52:31.840 --> 00:52:37.520
the end of the rule set. And it's going to check&nbsp;
for an allow, and if there is no allow, then by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:37.520 --> 00:52:43.760
default, it's just going to deny the traffic. As&nbsp;
I mentioned, a security group can use a source of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:52:43.760 --> 00:52:50.720
an IP address an IP address range, or the security&nbsp;
group ID of itself or another security group. Now&nbsp;&nbsp;

