that's the name of this security group. So&nbsp;
it's only going to allow traffic outbound&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:03.920 --> 00:54:10.880
to the web front end, the web front end allows&nbsp;
traffic only from the public lb on port 80. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:10.880 --> 00:54:17.680
then it has a destination for outbound traffic&nbsp;
of another security group called private lb,&nbsp;&nbsp;

