one which has the application layer in it. So&nbsp;
that's a way that we're locking down access&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:42.960 --> 00:54:48.240
to the different layers of our application,&nbsp;
and ensuring that the application can talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:54:48.240 --> 00:54:52.400
to other components but nothing else can.&nbsp;
So that's the best practice security group&nbsp;&nbsp;

