you can have an explicit deny that's different&nbsp;
to security groups. Remember, security groups&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:10.560 --> 00:55:16.160
only support allow rules. Rules are processed&nbsp;
in order. So you can see that they're numbered.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:55:16.160 --> 00:55:20.720
So we typically number our rules. And you might&nbsp;
want to say that the next rules that you add in&nbsp;&nbsp;

