In the Direct Connect location, AWS have a cage&nbsp;
so they have a rack full of their own equipment.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:21.840 --> 01:46:27.280
And then there's the customer or partner cage.&nbsp;
So either you have a rack with some equipment in&nbsp;&nbsp;

