allocated for you. And then what you do is cross&nbsp;
connects between the customer or partner router,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:46:57.840 --> 01:47:05.680
and AWS, we then have a customer router, actually&nbsp;
in your data center, and direct connects in AWS.&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:47:06.640 --> 01:47:13.920
And we can form the Direct Connect connection. So&nbsp;
now, from your customer router, you need to have&nbsp;&nbsp;

