50 megabits per second upwards. So let's have a&nbsp;
look at some of the benefits. You've got private&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:04.960 --> 01:48:11.680
connectivity between AWS and your data center or&nbsp;
office, you get a consistent network experience,&nbsp;&nbsp;

