you can control the network path, it's not like&nbsp;
on the internet where you just don't know what's&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:16.400 --> 01:48:22.160
happening. That means you can increase the&nbsp;
speed, improve latency, get better bandwidth&nbsp;&nbsp;

