and throughput for your connection. dx can&nbsp;
be quite expensive for many customers. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:48:27.920 --> 01:48:33.920
for those who transfer a lot of data from their&nbsp;
data center into AWS, it can be cost effective.&nbsp;&nbsp;

